cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (this record) and the original ProSMoS method paper."
title: "ProSMoS — protein secondary-structure motif search engine"
abstract: >-
  A hardened, source-available working copy of the ProSMoS engine (Shi et al., ~2010) that
  searches the Protein Data Bank for proteins matching a user-supplied meta-matrix of
  interactions between secondary-structure elements. This tree adds defect fixes, a build
  system, a hardened meta-matrix database reader, and loop inversion in the search path; it
  is the search engine used by the four-strand β-sheet topology census. Released under
  PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 (source-available, not open source). See NOTICE.md for
  provenance.
